        {
          "title": "Fix perform_checkin given_answers typing and OrderChangeManager.add_position addon_to type",
          "detail": "In app/eventyay/base/services/checkin.py line 380: perform_checkin has 'given_answers: dict'. Check the type of values by examining _save_answers (line 324): it iterates 'for q, a in given_answers.items()' where q is a Question and a is a QuestionAnswer. At the top of checkin.py add: 'from typing import TypeAlias; GivenAnswers: TypeAlias = dict[Question, QuestionAnswer]'. Then update line 380 to 'given_answers: GivenAnswers'. In app/eventyay/base/services/orders.py line 1707: OrderChangeManager.add_position has 'addon_to: Order = None'. The parameter is used at line 1711+ to set an OrderPosition's addon_to ForeignKey. Change to 'addon_to: OrderPosition | None = None' importing OrderPosition (already imported in this file). In app/eventyay/base/services/orders.py: also fix _check_positions at line 600 \u2014 'positions' annotated as list but receives QuerySet; change to 'positions: QuerySet | list[CartPosition]'.",
          "effort": "small",
          "issue_refs": [
