        },
        {
          "title": "Add return type annotations to all major public service functions and fix STATUS_REFUNDED alias",
          "detail": "In app/eventyay/base/models/orders.py line 161: 'STATUS_REFUNDED = c' is STATUS_CANCELED alias with no deprecation notice. Add a comment '# deprecated alias: use STATUS_CANCELED instead' and a property or __init_subclass__ DeprecationWarning. In app/eventyay/base/services/orders.py: add return type annotations \u2014 reactivate_order at line 153 returns order.pk (int), add '-> int'; approve_order at line 286 returns order.pk, add '-> int'; deny_order at line 359 returns order.pk, add '-> int'; extend_order at line 206 returns None, add '-> None'. In app/eventyay/api/serializers/order.py lines 61-82: CountryField.to_internal_value and CompatibleCountryField.to_representation have no return type annotations. Add '-> str' and '-> dict' respectively. Also fix _cancel_order and mark_order_refunded for CC-05: add 'user: int | Model | None = None' annotation to document polymorphic parameter.",
          "effort": "small",
          "issue_refs": [
            "review::.::holistic::type_safety::ts-02",
            "review::.::holistic::type_safety::ts-06",
            "review::.::holistic::type_safety::ts-07",
            "review::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-02",
            "review::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-05",
            "review::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-06",
