        {
          "title": "Introduce TypedDicts for email and order pipeline context dicts",
          "detail": "In app/eventyay/base/services/mail.py: create a MailContext TypedDict \u2014 add 'from typing import TypedDict' at top. The TypedDict will be used with TYPE_CHECKING guard to avoid circular imports. Add to app/eventyay/base/services/mail.py (after existing imports): 'if TYPE_CHECKING: from typing import TypedDict; class MailContext(TypedDict, total=False): event: Event; order: Order; position: OrderPosition'. Change mail() signature at line 74 from 'context: dict[str, Any] = None' to 'context: MailContext | dict[str, Any] | None = None'. In app/eventyay/base/services/cart.py: fix _delete_out_of_timeframe at line 253 which returns err (possibly None) \u2014 add '-> str | None' return type. Fix _check_positions at line 600 in orders.py \u2014 add '-> None' and document that errors are raised, not returned. Also address LC-03 and LC-04: add '-> list[str]' return to _check_positions and change to accumulate ALL errors.",
          "effort": "medium",
