      "name": "convention-and-naming-fixes",
      "description": "Fix naming quality and convention outlier issues: rename check_access_permissions to clarify it raises exceptions, fix GeoCodeView variable shadowing in comprehensions, fix VersionView pretix/pretix_numeric key names, consolidate api/views/ structural patterns, address control/forms granularity inconsistency and control/views/__init__.py mass re-export",
