      ],
      "created_at": "2026-03-15T09:41:35+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-03-16T07:14:35+00:00",
      "auto": false,
      "cluster_key": "",
      "action": null,
      "user_modified": true,
      "action_steps": [
        {
          "title": "Rename check_access_permissions and fix GeoCodeView variable shadowing",
          "detail": "In app/eventyay/base/models/organizer.py line 38: check_access_permissions() raises Exception (lines 48, 73) and returns warnings (line 90) \u2014 it does both raising and returning, not just checking. Rename to enforce_access_permissions() and update the 3 call sites in app/eventyay/api/views/team.py (lines 76, 86, 170). In app/eventyay/control/views/geo.py: _use_opencage and _use_mapquest use variable 'r' both as HTTP response and as a comprehension variable \u2014 rename the comprehension variable to 'result' or 'item' to eliminate shadowing.",
          "effort": "trivial",
          "issue_refs": [
            "review::.::holistic::naming_quality::name_check_access_permissions_misleading",
            "review::.::holistic::naming_quality::name_geo_variable_shadowing"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Rename VersionView response keys and add LogMixin/PretalxModel deprecation aliases",
          "detail": "In app/eventyay/api/views/version.py lines 53-54: VersionView.get() returns {'pretix': __version__, 'pretix_numeric': numeric_version(__version__)}. Rename keys to {'version': __version__, 'version_numeric': numeric_version(__version__)}. Update any client code or tests that reference these keys. In app/eventyay/base/models/base.py: add 'LogMixin = LoggingMixin  # deprecated alias' below LoggingMixin class (or vice versa in mixins.py) with a comment pointing to the canonical. Link this with model-naming-and-base-cleanup cluster for the PretalxModel rename.",
          "effort": "small",
          "issue_refs": [
            "review::.::holistic::convention_outlier::conv_api_version_response_pretix_keys",
            "review::.::holistic::naming_quality::name_logmixin_loggedmodel_ambiguity",
            "review::.::holistic::convention_outlier::conv_dual_logging_mixin_naming"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Consolidate api/views structural patterns and control/forms granularity",
          "detail": "In app/eventyay/api/views/__init__.py: add a module-level docstring defining the structural pattern (PretalxViewSetMixin-based ViewSets preferred for resources, plain APIViews for actions, FBVs only for one-off utility endpoints). In app/eventyay/control/forms/: count files with multiple classes vs one-class files; pick single-class-per-file strategy (organizer_forms/ style) or multi-class; apply to whichever module has fewer files to convert. In app/eventyay/control/views/__init__.py: this file is not a mass re-exporter (it has PaginationMixin, CreateView, UpdateView etc.); verify the issue is not a false positive and add a note if it already passes review.",
          "effort": "medium",
          "issue_refs": [
