    "strategy_summary": "Two-pass triage complete. Round 1 organized core code-health clusters (mechanical issues, design clarity). Round 2 (87 review findings) grouped into 40+ clusters. Priority order: (1) ai-debt-cleanup and error-handling-standardization (no deps, quick wins), (2) log-action-consolidation, (3) base-layer-import-fixes and authorization-consistency in parallel, (4) type-annotation-sweep and service-return-contracts, (5) naming-cleanup and convention-and-naming-fixes, (6) design-refactors and base-package-structure. Skip test-coverage-expansion and pyproject-dependency-fixes as they require coordination beyond code fixes.",
