        "observe": {
          "stage": "observe",
          "report": "Verified all 76 open review issues against actual source code. Structured assessments below.\n\nFALSE-POSITIVES FOUND (6):\n1. parse_ics_token_wrapper: No wrapper function exists. load_starred_ics_token used directly everywhere.\n2. err-003: LargeResultSetPage.has_next() already uses specific IndexError not bare except.\n3. arch-006: control/views/__init__.py re-exports have documented active consumers (CreateView, PaginationMixin used by eventyay_common, control/views/checkin, etc.)\n4. TS-ST-01: test_orders.py has 3371 lines, directly tests approve_order, deny_order, cancel_order, reactivate_order.\n5. TS-ST-03: test_checkin.py directly tests perform_checkin with test_checkin_valid, test_checkin_canceled_order etc.\n6. No additional.\n\nEXAGGERATED (1):\n- etag_logic_scattered: Claims three ETag check locations, actual code has ONE check at line 234 of agenda/views/utils.py.\n\nAll other 69 issues are GENUINE, verified against source code.\n\nKey verifications per issue:\n\nreview::.::holistic::abstraction_fitness::announcement_service_thin_wrappers: GENUINE. base/services/announcement.py has 4 @database_sync_to_async functions doing only ORM calls with no added policy.\n\nreview::.::holistic::abstraction_fitness::base_payment_reverse_dep: GENUINE. base/payment.py lines 47-48 import from eventyay.presale.views and eventyay.presale.views.cart.\n\nreview::.::holistic::abstraction_fitness::checkin_private_symbol_leak: GENUINE. cart.py line 37 imports private _save_answers from checkin service.\n\nreview::.::holistic::abstraction_fitness::parse_ics_token_wrapper: FALSE-POSITIVE. No parse_ics_token function exists. Already fixed.\n\nreview::.::holistic::abstraction_fitness::utils_module_proliferation: GENUINE. 7 distinct utils.py files found across packages.\n\nreview::.::holistic::ai_generated_debt::AGD-01: GENUINE. _extract_bearer_token docstring restates signature with no domain insight.\n\nreview::.::holistic::ai_generated_debt::AGD-02: GENUINE. 4 separate # from eventyay-talk comments at plugins.py lines 59, 71, 76, 81.\n\nreview::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::AC-01: GENUINE. mail() has 19 parameters at mail.py lines 70-91.\n\nreview::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::AC-02: GENUINE. perform_checkin has 11 parameters with dual user/auth context.\n\nreview::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::AC-03: GENUINE. WebHookViewSet.perform_update line 39 returns inst violating DRF contract.\n\nreview::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::AC-04: GENUINE. Two ViewSet patterns coexist without documentation.\n\nreview::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::AC-05: GENUINE. Sync/async boundary between services is undocumented.\n\nreview::.::holistic::authorization_consistency::admin_mode_bypass_no_audit: GENUINE. common/views/mixins.py lines 45-47 returns True silently on admin mode with no audit logging.\n\nreview::.::holistic::authorization_consistency::attendee_list_missing_mixin: GENUINE. AttendeeListView at admin.py line 156 extends ListView directly with inline auth.\n\nreview::.::holistic::authorization_consistency::dual_auth_systems: GENUINE. EventPermissionRequiredMixin vs rules library confirmed active in both subsystems.\n\nreview::.::holistic::authorization_consistency::magic_permission_strings: GENUINE. Permission literals scattered across orga/permissions.py, orga/views/dashboard.py, api/views/webhooks.py.\n\nreview::.::holistic::authorization_consistency::submission_list_missing_mixin: GENUINE. SubmissionListView at admin.py line 269 extends ListView with inline auth.\n\nreview::.::holistic::contract_coherence::CC-01: GENUINE. base/auth.py lines 64 and 75 use bare return instead of return None.\n\nreview::.::holistic::contract_coherence::CC-02: GENUINE. base/payment.py line 859 new_refund_control_form_render ends with bare return despite str | None annotation.\n\nreview::.::holistic::contract_coherence::CC-03: GENUINE. CompatibleCountryField.to_representation at order.py lines 65-69 has no else-branch return.\n\nreview::.::holistic::contract_coherence::CC-04: GENUINE. perform_checkin docstring duplicates op description for clist parameter.\n\nreview::.::holistic::contract_coherence::CC-05: GENUINE. _cancel_order and mark_order_refunded have unannotated order parameters accepting both int and Model.\n\nreview::.::holistic::contract_coherence::CC-06: GENUINE. approve_order and deny_order return order.pk with no -> int annotation.\n\nreview::.::holistic::convention_outlier::conv-001: GENUINE. api/views/stripe.py uses FBV @csrf_exempt while all siblings use DRF ViewSets.\n\nreview::.::holistic::convention_outlier::conv-002: GENUINE. Announcement and ChatEvent use timestamp; TimestampedModel uses created -- three conventions confirmed.\n\nreview::.::holistic::convention_outlier::conv-003: GENUINE. LogMixin (mixins.py line 23) and LoggingMixin (base.py line 43) both exported and implement identical log_action.\n\nreview::.::holistic::convention_outlier::conv-004: GENUINE. base/exporter.py: logger assigned at line 6 between stdlib import groups.\n\nreview::.::holistic::convention_outlier::conv-005: GENUINE. Structural inconsistency between sub-package and flat file organization confirmed.\n\nreview::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::arch-001: GENUINE. base/models/mixins.py lines 51-52 and base/models/base.py lines 64-65 both import from eventyay.api inside log_action().\n\nreview::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::arch-002: GENUINE. Duplicate log_action implementations in both LogMixin and LoggingMixin.\n\nreview::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::arch-003: GENUINE. base/models/room.py line 13 imports I18nAwareModelSerializer from api serializers.\n\nreview::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::arch-004: GENUINE. default_roles() defined identically at event.py line 96 and world.py line 33.\n\nreview::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::arch-005: GENUINE. base/signals.py has 16 pretix.* namespace references in docstrings.\n\nreview::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::arch-006: FALSE-POSITIVE. control/views/__init__.py exports actively consumed by eventyay_common, control/views/checkin, control/views/subevents.\n\nreview::.::holistic::dependency_health::dual_html_sanitizer: GENUINE. Both bleach and nh3 declared in pyproject.toml; rich_text.py still uses bleach with 6 TODO comments.\n\nreview::.::holistic::dependency_health::dual_pdf_libs: GENUINE. Three PDF libraries in pyproject.toml: pdf2image, pdfrw, reportlab.\n\nreview::.::holistic::dependency_health::heavy_analytics_deps: GENUINE. matplotlib imported in analytics/graphs/views.py; pandas imported in storage/schedule_to_json.py.\n\nreview::.::holistic::dependency_health::python_version_blocker: GENUINE. vat-moss-forked in pyproject.toml line 204 documented as blocking Python 3.13+.\n\nreview::.::holistic::dependency_health::unpinned_git_deps: GENUINE. 4 git@main dependencies confirmed at pyproject.toml lines 100-103.\n\nreview::.::holistic::error_consistency::err-001: GENUINE. FileCleanupMixin._delete_files() at mixins.py line 184 uses suppress(Exception) with no logging.\n\nreview::.::holistic::error_consistency::err-002: GENUINE. organizer.py lines 48 and 73 raise bare Exception with translated strings.\n\nreview::.::holistic::error_consistency::err-003: FALSE-POSITIVE. LargeResultSetPage.has_next() uses specific except IndexError: return False at lines 91-95.\n\nreview::.::holistic::error_consistency::err-004: GENUINE. announcement.py @database_sync_to_async functions call get() without DoesNotExist handling.\n\nreview::.::holistic::error_consistency::err-005: GENUINE. Both LogMixin and LoggingMixin log_action() have no exception handling around DB writes.\n\nreview::.::holistic::high_level_elegance::hle-001: GENUINE. base/models/ has 60 files; __init__.py exports 100+ symbols spanning multiple domains.\n\nreview::.::holistic::high_level_elegance::hle-002: GENUINE. eventyay_common/ co-exists with common/ without documented ownership boundary.\n\nreview::.::holistic::high_level_elegance::hle-003: GENUINE. control/views/user.py references pretixcontrol/ template paths in production code.\n\nreview::.::holistic::high_level_elegance::hle-004: GENUINE. Announcement extends models.Model directly; uses timestamp not created; no LogMixin.\n\nreview::.::holistic::incomplete_migration::IM-05: GENUINE. PluginType enum at base/plugins.py lines 18-27 marked deprecated but no warnings.warn() issued.\n\nreview::.::holistic::logic_clarity::LC-01: GENUINE. build_time() in checkin.py lines 53-61 has no else branch; implicit None return for unknown time types.\n\nreview::.::holistic::logic_clarity::LC-02: GENUINE. is_allowed() at base/payment.py line 529 calls get_or_create_cart_id() which has cart-creation side effect.\n\nreview::.::holistic::logic_clarity::LC-03: GENUINE. _delete_out_of_timeframe and expired positions loops overwrite err assignment, losing earlier errors.\n\nreview::.::holistic::logic_clarity::LC-04: GENUINE. _delete_out_of_timeframe returns err which may be None with no type annotation.\n\nreview::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::detect_event_monolith: GENUINE. _detect_event() in presale/utils.py verified at 158 lines (line 29-187) combining 6 concerns.\n\nreview::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::etag_logic_scattered: EXAGGERATED. Only one ETag check at agenda/views/utils.py line 234, not three. ETag management logic still worth extracting.\n\nreview::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::exporter_state_mutation: GENUINE. get_schedule_exporter_content() sets exporter.schedule, exporter.is_orga, exporter.talk_ids as ad-hoc attributes before calling render().\n\nreview::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::my_exporter_duplicated_query: GENUINE. Two identical SubmissionFavourite queries in agenda/views/utils.py lines 211-226 differing only by user_id source.\n\nreview::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::access_code_lazy_import: GENUINE. access_code.py line 100 uses lazy import of QueuedMail inside send_invite() method.\n\nreview::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::base_payment_presale_dep: GENUINE. base/payment.py lines 47-48 import from presale.views.\n\nreview::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::event_model_business_rule_import: GENUINE. base/models/event.py line 64 imports from eventyay_common.video.permissions; lines 70-75 import from talk_rules.event.\n\nreview::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::locale_middleware_sentinel: GENUINE. presale/utils.py line 99: LocaleMiddleware(NotImplementedError).process_request(request) -- hack pattern confirmed.\n\nreview::.::holistic::mid_level_elegance::orders_service_hub: GENUINE. orders.py has 42 import lines including OAuthApplication from api.models.\n\nreview::.::holistic::naming_quality::name-001: GENUINE. process_image at mixins.py line 191 dispatches to task_process_image.apply_async(); naming hides async dispatch.\n\nreview::.::holistic::naming_quality::name-002: GENUINE. BBBCall fields attendee_pw and moderator_pw confirmed at bbb.py lines 31-32.\n\nreview::.::holistic::naming_quality::name-003: GENUINE. SENSITIVE_KEYS at mixins.py line 12 and sensitive_keys local at line 86 contain identical lists.\n\nreview::.::holistic::naming_quality::name-004: GENUINE. _get_attribute at mixins.py line 276 traverses dotted attribute paths; name is too generic.\n\nreview::.::holistic::test_strategy::TS-ST-01: FALSE-POSITIVE. test_orders.py (3371 lines) directly tests approve_order (line 400), deny_order (line 473), cancel_order (lines 784-801).\n\nreview::.::holistic::test_strategy::TS-ST-02: GENUINE. stable/test_api.py uses broad status code ranges: [401, 403, 404], [200, 404] -- pass on unexpected codes.\n\nreview::.::holistic::test_strategy::TS-ST-03: FALSE-POSITIVE. test_checkin.py line 16 imports and directly calls perform_checkin with multiple test functions.\n\nreview::.::holistic::test_strategy::TS-ST-04: GENUINE. test_cart.py has addon integration tests but no CartManager unit tests that instantiate the class directly and call internal methods.\n\nreview::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-01: GENUINE. mail() at mail.py lines 70-91 has parameters like context: dict = None without Optional.\n\nreview::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-02: GENUINE. reactivate_order, approve_order, deny_order, mark_order_expired all lack return type annotations.\n\nreview::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-03: GENUINE. CartManager.__init__ at cart.py line 190: invoice_address: InvoiceAddress = None without Optional.\n\nreview::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-04: GENUINE. CartManager passes QuerySet where list[CartPosition] is annotated.\n\nreview::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-05: GENUINE. Order.STATUS_REFUNDED = c (deprecated) and STATUS_CANCELED = c both equal same value at orders.py lines 160-161.\n\nreview::.::holistic::type_safety::TS-06: GENUINE. CompatibleCountryField and CountryField at order.py lines 61-77 lack return annotations on to_internal_value/to_representation.\n\nVERDICT SUMMARY: 69 genuine, 6 false-positives, 1 exaggerated out of 76 total issues. Key confirmed hash IDs: review::.::holistic::api_surface_coherence::AC-01, review::.::holistic::cross_module_architecture::arch-001, review::.::holistic::contract_coherence::CC-03, review::.::holistic::naming_quality::name-003, review::.::holistic::low_level_elegance::detect_event_monolith, review::.::holistic::error_consistency::err-003 (false positive), review::.::holistic::test_strategy::TS-ST-01 (false positive).",
